relation Lvalue_read: p EC' STO |- storageReference'' : %

1. If ((storageReference'' has type prefixedNameIR)), then

  1. (Let prefixedNameIR be (storageReference'' as prefixedNameIR))

  2. Group referenceExpressionIR: p EC' STO |- (prefixedNameIR as storageReference) : %

    1. (Let value be $find_var_e(p, EC', prefixedNameIR))

    2. Result in : % % % |- % : value

2. If ((storageReference'' matches pattern `%.%`)), then

  1. (Let (storageReference . nameIR) be storageReference'')

  2. Group storageReference-nameIR: p EC' STO |- (storageReference . nameIR) : %

    1. (Lvalue_read: p EC' STO |- storageReference : value_base)

    2. Case analysis on value_base

      1. Case (% has type objectReferenceValue)

