          2. Case (% has type continueResult<storageReference?>)

            1. (Let (` storageReference'?{storageReference' <- storageReference'?}) be (storageReferenceResult as continueResult<storageReference?>))

            2. If ((storageReference'?{storageReference' <- storageReference'?} matches pattern (_))), then

              1. (Let ?(storageReference) be storageReference'?{storageReference' <- storageReference'?})

